  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The length of the name of the avatar that can be shown in the main menu seems to be really short (shorter than in the old main menu). However, if I were to open the avatar wing either in the main menu or quick menu, when I hover over an avatar, I can see the full name, at least with my own avatars. I feel like the main menu, having a lot more space to work with, should be able to display longer names, at least on par with the avatar wing, if not longer.\nAlso, if you hover over an avatar in the avatar wing, you can see the full length of the name at the bottom of the menu as well. The main menu does not do that unfortunately and the only way to see the full title is by opening the avatar details. That is much slower than seeing the name in the bottom to quickly tell apart different variants of the same avatar that you have.\nThis is probably not an issue for most people, but because my names are a bit longer, it's getting cut off very quickly and there is no way to quickly check the name. If I had more avatars and more variants of the same avatar that look the same or too similar in the thumbnail, I wouldn't be able to easily tell them apart by name either unless I fully open avatar details, while the avatar wing can display more information in a much smaller space.",
